      <h2 class="footer__heading">About L'okawa</h2>
      <p class="footer__text">
        Safaris, gorilla trekking, hotel bookings, airport transfers and group travel across Uganda, Kenya, Tanzania and Rwanda.
      </p>
      <div class="footer__socials">
        <a href="https://facebook.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook" class="footer__social-link">
